(7691044, 1260267, 173844, '<td valign="top">The thing about pi, at least to me, is the fuzzy, indeterminate nature of the beast.  And yet it''s crucial in so many mathematical scenarios.  This swirly, almost manic, circular plate, with its tree reflections and kind of overlaps, sums up my own sense of wonder and discontent.  Served with a slice!<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'The thing about pi, at least to me, is the fuzzy, indeterminate nature of the beast.  And yet it''s crucial in so many mathematical scenarios.  This swirly, almost manic, circular plate, with its tree reflections and kind of overlaps, sums up my own sense of wonder and discontent.  Served with a slice!Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2021-04-04 22:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691046, 1260270, 103142, '<td valign="top">Wow! Long time no see! You always did know how to make an entrance. :)</td>', 'Wow! Long time no see! You always did know how to make an entrance. :)', '2021-04-04 23:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691049, 1260270, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fascinating - as always! - take on mysterious pi.  There''s a Vitruvian Man look going, 3, echoed and extended by smaller versions of him ticking off the digits of the endless ratio.  Then tumbling off into disarray.  So clever, and such a fine translation of the math into human terms.  The guys gliding in from the upper left introduce the notion of fertilization, sperm into egg.  Don''t know if it''s intentional or not, but I like.  Outside the box, excellently so.<br/>Second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Fascinating - as always! - take on mysterious pi.  There''s a Vitruvian Man look going, 3, echoed and extended by smaller versions of him ticking off the digits of the endless ratio.  Then tumbling off into disarray.  So clever, and such a fine translation of the math into human terms.  The guys gliding in from the upper left introduce the notion of fertilization, sperm into egg.  Don''t know if it''s intentional or not, but I like.  Outside the box, excellently so.Second favorite of the challenge.', '2021-04-04 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691059, 1260261, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seemingly disparate elements, but they grew on me as I kept gazing.  I like the cleanliness of the overall image.  The statue of pi might be excessive, but that''s just subjective.  The knife, as it blurs into the sky, is like a bridge to the infinite, or something.  And the little pie is that tantalizing decimal point trumpeting the wild continuation.  Interesting, otherworldly take on the challenge.</td>', 'Seemingly disparate elements, but they grew on me as I kept gazing.  I like the cleanliness of the overall image.  The statue of pi might be excessive, but that''s just subjective.  The knife, as it blurs into the sky, is like a bridge to the infinite, or something.  And the little pie is that tantalizing decimal point trumpeting the wild continuation.  Interesting, otherworldly take on the challenge.', '2021-04-05 00:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691061, 1260257, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the messiness of it, a fall of confetti, which seems to represent the unresolvable confusion of the whole deal.</td>', 'I like the messiness of it, a fall of confetti, which seems to represent the unresolvable confusion of the whole deal.', '2021-04-05 00:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691062, 1260256, 173844, '<td valign="top">My favorite take on baking a pie.  The hyper-real overhead view puts the viewer smack in the middle of the process.  It feels like I''m working along with the baker.  And I want my slice!</td>', 'My favorite take on baking a pie.  The hyper-real overhead view puts the viewer smack in the middle of the process.  It feels like I''m working along with the baker.  And I want my slice!', '2021-04-05 00:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691063, 1260228, 173844, '<td valign="top">Clean and hearty look.  Nice blend of white and golden brown.</td>', 'Clean and hearty look.  Nice blend of white and golden brown.', '2021-04-05 00:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7691067, 1260270, 67145, '<td valign="top">AMAZING .. !! ..<br/>so much of what you expressed in your photograph was lost to me until i read your notes .. <br/>once again an image that has so much going on visually .. but also what the visual represents .. levels where you can go deeper if you so desire .. you have said before that you are no great shakes as a photographer .. but i suppose you are someone who expects a lot of themselves .. i think of you as a visionary .. who takes great photographs and then transforms them into your thoughts and feelings about our world .. not just thoughts and feelings ... but beliefs as well .. <br/>congratulations on another unforgettable image and the story behind it .. and of course the blue .. :)<br/></td>', 'AMAZING .. !! ..so much of what you expressed in your photograph was lost to me until i read your notes .. once again an image that has so much going on visually .. but also what the visual represents .. levels where you can go deeper if you so desire .. you have said before that you are no great shakes as a photographer .. but i suppose you are someone who expects a lot of themselves .. i think of you as a visionary .. who takes great photographs and then transforms them into your thoughts and feelings about our world .. not just thoughts and feelings ... but beliefs as well .. congratulations on another unforgettable image and the story behind it .. and of course the blue .. :)', '2021-04-05 02:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691068, 1260256, 67145, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL .. <br/>congratulations on such a great pic .. and the ribbon .. <br/>i just noticed that where the hand is inside the pie dish there seems to be a bit of oof .. which actually adds to this image .. gives it sense of movement .. <br/>btw .. looks even better bigger after rollover .. bit of a tongue twister there .. ;)</td>', 'WONDERFUL .. congratulations on such a great pic .. and the ribbon .. i just noticed that where the hand is inside the pie dish there seems to be a bit of oof .. which actually adds to this image .. gives it sense of movement .. btw .. looks even better bigger after rollover .. bit of a tongue twister there .. ;)', '2021-04-05 02:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691069, 1260261, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by streetpigeon:</b></div><hr/><i> Seemingly disparate elements, but they grew on me as I kept gazing.  I like the cleanliness of the overall image.  The statue of pi might be excessive, but that''s just subjective.  The knife, as it blurs into the sky, is like a bridge to the infinite, or something.  And the little pie is that tantalizing decimal point trumpeting the wild continuation.  Interesting, otherworldly take on the challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thought this would get the blue or the red .. it really was a toss-up for me .. <br/>but that was before i fully grasped Christophe''s inspired message in his photo .. which i did after reading his notes ..<br/>and then of course Mark''s was awesome as well .. there were so many in the top 10 that were fantastic .. really brought out the creativity this challenge . .<br/> <br/>i loved this so much in voting .. and look at that .. i was your only 10 .. !! ..<br/>loving Rich''s comment .. !! ..  he said what i would have liked to but lacked the words .. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by streetpigeon: Seemingly disparate elements, but they grew on me as I kept gazing.  I like the cleanliness of the overall image.  The statue of pi might be excessive, but that''s just subjective.  The knife, as it blurs into the sky, is like a bridge to the infinite, or something.  And the little pie is that tantalizing decimal point trumpeting the wild continuation.  Interesting, otherworldly take on the challenge.   thought this would get the blue or the red .. it really was a toss-up for me .. but that was before i fully grasped Christophe''s inspired message in his photo .. which i did after reading his notes ..and then of course Mark''s was awesome as well .. there were so many in the top 10 that were fantastic .. really brought out the creativity this challenge . . i loved this so much in voting .. and look at that .. i was your only 10 .. !! ..loving Rich''s comment .. !! ..  he said what i would have liked to but lacked the words .. :)', '2021-04-05 03:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
