(7691123, 1260270, 30214, '<td valign="top">Congrats on you ribbon Christophe! Was never in doubt it would win. The effort you put into your magnificent creations is just mind-boggling, I never cease to be awed. Just out of sheer curiosity, how many different photos were used for this image?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2021-04-05 16:02:55.</i></td>', 'Congrats on you ribbon Christophe! Was never in doubt it would win. The effort you put into your magnificent creations is just mind-boggling, I never cease to be awed. Just out of sheer curiosity, how many different photos were used for this image?', '2021-04-05 17:02:15.000000', '2021-04-05 17:02:55.000000', 0),
(7691126, 1260270, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on you ribbon Christophe! Was never in doubt it would win. The effort you put into your magnificent creations is just mind-boggling, I never cease to be awed. Just out of sheer curiosity, how many different photos were used for this image? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks a lot, very kind of you. There are 33 different photos used in there, but some are related to details (for example, the hands of the main character are separate shots: I liked the face expression and light, but not the fingers position).</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Congrats on you ribbon Christophe! Was never in doubt it would win. The effort you put into your magnificent creations is just mind-boggling, I never cease to be awed. Just out of sheer curiosity, how many different photos were used for this image?   Thanks a lot, very kind of you. There are 33 different photos used in there, but some are related to details (for example, the hands of the main character are separate shots: I liked the face expression and light, but not the fingers position).', '2021-04-05 18:16:48.000000', NULL, 0),
